(b) of a definite person or thing, indicating quality, "either generic, which, as other like things, or essential, which by its very nature" (Hort on 1פ.2:11), who is such as: מתי.2:6 7:26, לוקס.2:10 7:37, יוחנן.8:53, מע״ש.7:53, רומים.6:2, 1קור.3:17, גל.4:24, אפ.1:23, ועוד;
