en.fuller:
πρός,
prep. with genitive, dative, accusative
__I. I. C. genitive, of motion from a place, from the side of, hence metaphorically, in the interests of, Act.27:34 (cf. Page, in l.).
__II. II. C. dative, of local proximity, hard by, near, at: Mrk.5:11, Luk.19:37, Jhn.18:16 20:11, 12 Rev.1:13.
__III. C. accusative, of motion or direction towards a place or object, to, towards.
__1. Of place,
__(a) after verbs of motion or of speaking and other words with the idea of direction: ἔρχομαι, ἀναβαίνω, πορεύομαι, λέγω, ἐπιστολή, etc., Mat.3:14, Mrk.6:51, Luk.11:5, Jhn.2:3, Act.9:2, al. mult.; metaphorically, of mental direction, hostile or otherwise, Luk.23:12, Jhn.6:52, 2Co.7:4, Eph.6:12, Col.3:13, al.; of the issue or end, Luk.14:32, Jhn.11:4, al.; of purpose, Mat.26:12, Rom.3:26, 1Co.6:5, al.; πρὸς τό, with inf., denoting purpose (cf. M, Pr., 218, 220; Lft., Notes, 131), Mat.5:28, Mrk.13:22, Eph.6:11, 1Th.2:9, al.;
__(b) of close proximity, at, by, with: Mat.3:10, Mrk.11:4, Luk.4:11, Act.3:2, al.; after εἶναι, Mat.13:56, Mrk.6:3, Jhn.1:1, al.
__2. 2. Of time,
__(a) towards (Plat., Xen., LXX: Gen.8:11, al.): Luk.24:29;
__(b) for: πρὸς καιρόν, Luk.8:13, 1Co.7:5; πρὸς ὥραν, Jhn.5:35, al.; πρὸς ὀλίγον, Jas.4:14.
__3. Of relation
__(a) toward, with: Rom.5:1, 2Co.1:12, Col.4:5, 1Th.4:12, al.;
__(b) with regard to: Mat.19:8, Mrk.12:12, Rom.8:31, al.;
__(with) pertaining to, to: Mat.27:4, Jhn.21:22, Rom.15:17, Heb.2:17 5:1;
__(d) according to: Luk.12:47, 2Co.5:10, Gal.2:14, Eph.3:4 4:14;
__(e) in comparison with: Rom.8:18.
__IV. In composition: towards (προσέρχομαι), to (προσάγω), against (προσκόπτω), besides (προσδαπανάω) .
(AS)

he.fuller:
πρός,
prep. עם יחס׳, עקיף, ישי׳
I. I. C. יחס׳, of motion from a place, from the side of, hence בהשאלה, in the interests of, מע״ש.27:34 (השוו Page, in l.).
II. II. C. עקיף, of local proximity, hard by, near, at: מרקוס.5:11, לוקס.19:37, יוחנן.18:16 20:11, 12 Rev.1:13.
III. C. ישי׳, of motion or direction towards a place or object, to, towards.
1. Of place,
(a) after verbs of motion or of speaking and other words with the idea of direction: ἔρχομαι, ἀναβαίνω, πορεύομαι, λέγω, ἐπιστολή, ועוד, מתי.3:14, מרקוס.6:51, לוקס.11:5, יוחנן.2:3, מע״ש.9:2, ועוד mult.; בהשאלה, of mental direction, hostile or otherwise, לוקס.23:12, יוחנן.6:52, 2קור.7:4, אפ.6:12, קל.3:13, ועוד; of the issue or end, לוקס.14:32, יוחנן.11:4, ועוד; of purpose, מתי.26:12, רומים.3:26, 1קור.6:5, ועוד; πρὸς τό, עם מקור, denoting purpose (השוו M, Pr., 218, 220; Lft., Notes, 131), מתי.5:28, מרקוס.13:22, אפ.6:11, 1תס.2:9, ועוד;
(b) of close proximity, at, by, with: מתי.3:10, מרקוס.11:4, לוקס.4:11, מע״ש.3:2, ועוד; after εἶναι, מתי.13:56, מרקוס.6:3, יוחנן.1:1, ועוד
2. 2. Of time,
(a) towards (Plat., Xen., LXX: בר.8:11, ועוד): לוקס.24:29;
(b) for: πρὸς καιρόν, לוקס.8:13, 1קור.7:5; πρὸς ὥραν, יוחנן.5:35, ועוד; πρὸς ὀλίγον, יעק.4:14.
3. Of relation
(a) toward, with: רומים.5:1, 2קור.1:12, קל.4:5, 1תס.4:12, ועוד;
(b) with regard to: מתי.19:8, מרקוס.12:12, רומים.8:31, ועוד;
(with) pertaining to, to: מתי.27:4, יוחנן.21:22, רומים.15:17, עב.2:17 5:1;
(d) according to: לוקס.12:47, 2קור.5:10, גל.2:14, אפ.3:4 4:14;
(e) in comparison with: רומים.8:18.
IV. In composition: towards (προσέρχομαι), to (προσάγω), against (προσκόπτω), besides (προσδαπανάω) .
(AS)

en.fuller:
